<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>
  <h1 class="text-align-center">Welcome to Maine Archery Association</h1><p class="text-align-center">The Maine Archery Association is an organization dedicated to promoting all forms of archery – recreational, tournament, and hunting in the State of Maine. We are a chartered state organization of the National Field Archery Association. Annually we host NFAA sectional tournaments and State Championships for both indoor target and outdoor field. We also hold NFAA "Shooter of the Year" tournaments every Sunday from October through March of each year with different venues throughout the state hosting each week. We welcome archers of all levels from beginner to professional to join our organization and help grow the sport of archery in Maine.</p>
